MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_001: This damn war... It's dumb, pointless. How'd I ever\nget roped into this? Ridiculous...
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_002: I'm not staying a minute longer. My bags are packed\nand I am outta here!
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_003: <NCA>"Where are you going?"
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_004: <NCB>"What's your plan?"
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_005: Course you found out. You're the Promised One. \nI'm just unlucky.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_006: I'm getting out of here. Don't try to stop me.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_007: <NCA>"There's nowhere to go."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_008: Ah, shut it. You think I don't know that?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_009: All of Dagda's falling apart... It's one big, brutal\nbattlefield. Nowhere's safe...
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_010: Seems to me I got no choice but to embrace my true\nself. I'm a bandit and a thief, always have been.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_011: My parents ditched me as a baby, you know that?\nGuess who rescued and raised me? Bandits!
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_012: Hell if I care if anyone calls me a bad guy. It's the \nonly life I've known.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_013: Let people say whatever they want. I'm not sticking\naround for this fight. It's hopeless!
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_014: <NCA>"We can win this fight."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_015: Are you kidding me? You have seen who we're\nfighting against, right?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_016: <NCA>"It's not impossible."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_017: <NCB>"This is your chance to start over."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_018: <ACA>Now you just sound stupid. There's just no way,\nOK? Not even a chance.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_019: <ACB>Maybe, but what do you expect me to do?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_020: Ngh...
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_021: Oh, lay off with the guilt trip, will ya? Don't stare at\nme with that look in your eyes. It's weirding me out.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_A_022: Ugh... Fine, OK? Fine! If you want me to fight so\nbad, I'll fight. Just stop with the look.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_001: Hahaha! Ah, man. Look at all this stuff. Must be\nworth a pretty penny. Nobody's gonna miss it...
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_002: Huh?! Promised One! Wait, where'd you come from?\nAre you...alive?! How?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_003: Hey, it's not what it looks like. I'm not here to loot\nthis old, abandoned temple. I swear!
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_004: <NCA>"I thought you'd changed."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_005: <NCB>"You never learn."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_006: I told you, that's not what's going on! I'm here for, uh,\nanother reason...
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_007: Rrgh...
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_008: Aw, I give up. OK? It was a tiny slip, no big deal.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_009: Know what? The world's good again. It IS time I turn\nover a new leaf. Be a new man and all that.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_010: So, let's forget about this. Just this once. Please.\nI haven't even stolen anything! See?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_011: Ahh... You'll forgive me? Thank you, really. I, uh...\nguess I'll just get outta here. See you around.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_012: <NCA>"Hold on. You're not going anywhere."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_013: Huh? Wh-why not?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_014: <NCA>"I refuse to abandon you."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_015: <NCB>"I've got to keep an eye on you."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_016: <ACA>What? Sure you can! Abandon me all you want.\nI'm good! But... You're gonna insist, huh?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_017: <ACB>Hey, I don't need a babysitter or anyone telling me\nto behave myself.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_018: No offense, but hanging out with someone so...good\nall the time is gonna get old fast.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_019: <NCA>"You know, I live up to my promises."
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_020: Yeah, yeah... I know you do. But what does that\nhave to do with me?
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_021: Hey, stop... Stop with the look! I can't stand it\nwhen you do that.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_022: Guess I can't say no to your whole "not gonna\nbudge" thing. Damn, you're stubborn.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_023: <RSDS>Ugh, I'm gonna hate every second of this. And\nyou'll never let me sneak off.
MID_SE_Ism_Zac_S_024: A bandit like me, getting dragged along, helping save\nthe world... Oh, man, how'd it all go so wrong?